{"id":"C54cc2cf66931772b6b52","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","definition_zh":"受随机激励或随机参数影响产生的振动。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C025b590e5491e72bc214","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"随机分析","group_id":"Hf4cac7d2d942b3586897","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"随机分析 · Xu等（2019）"},{"id":"C54cc2cf66931772b6b52","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"Hf4cac7d2d942b3586897","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"},{"id":"C7092d6cf2b5f1ad6d43f","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","group_id":"Hf4cac7d2d942b3586897","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D73629c5299c32a31161e","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"随机振动"},{"id":"Dda7bffd34bbc3ac16eec","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"random vibration"}],"sources":{"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"},"P118":{"id":"P118","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2020","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2020.02.011","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2020）","overview_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S90d5607214c10aaaeb09","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"车辆-轨道系统的随机振动特性主要来源于激振源和系统参数的随机性,考虑到车辆-轨道系统理论计算条件与实际物理、力学状态间的差异,以及常规计算中激振源和车线参数的不完备性与时效不变性,亟待开展车辆-轨道系统的随机分析 [1-6]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S6ca9b309fd66f50d587a","source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"概率密度函数(PDF)抓住了随机动力响应幅值和概率两方面的特性,是分析随机振动统计信息的有力工具,也是动力可靠度计算的基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S0f5e3d17fa48764eb4e5","source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"显然,上述分析是随机振动计算时某一确定性工况下的计算分析,由车轮踏面磨耗的随机性可知,Ci(i =1,2,...,9)仅代表磨耗均值,各踏面点的磨耗量还存在变异性,再考虑C0工况下轨道不平顺的随机性,可知将车轮磨耗与轨道不平顺两者做随机激励考虑时, 车辆-轨道系统的动力响应无法用确定性分析(图2) 描述。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Cfe5c769416f190f39575","target_concept_id":"Cfe5c769416f190f39575","target_zh":"概率密度函数","target_en":"probability density function","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c","target_concept_id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c","target_zh":"随机分析","target_en":"stochastic analysis","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C8506c798372688337476","target_concept_id":"C8506c798372688337476","target_zh":"踏面磨耗","target_en":"wheel tread wear","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P118","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2020","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2020.02.011","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2020）","overview_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe"},{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}]}